## $XCX Buyback & Burn Mechanism

1. Automatic Burn  
   Automatically burns 1% of the XCX amount and 0.2% of the AI Influencer token amount in each eligible bonding curve transaction, with burns recorded on-chain.

2. Monthly Revenue-linked Burn  
   Each month, Xeleb applies 30% of reported revenue from bonding activities, marketplace fees, AI services, and other revenue streams to one of two burn methods:
   - Buyback & Burn: Uses allocated funds to repurchase XCX from the open market and permanently burn the acquired tokens.
   - Treasury Burn: Burns existing Treasury XCX with a reference value equivalent to 30% of reported monthly revenue.
   
   The method used is specified in each monthly report.

3. Team Allocation Burn  
   The team may voluntarily burn a portion of its allocated $XCX, in addition to automatic burns and monthly revenue buybacks. Each burn will disclose the token amount, source wallet, and on-chain transaction details.

